<title>NETHERLANDS: Aalberts Industries new shares placed.</title>
<headline>Aalberts Industries new shares placed.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO said on Wednesday ABN AMRO Rothschild had place 210,000 new ordinary shares of industrial group Aalberts Industries with institutional investors at the price of 188 guilders per share.</p>
<p>The new shares are fully entitled to the dividend over the financial year 1996 and are fungible with the existing shares, ABN AMRO said.</p>
<p>Aalberts Industry shares closed at 195.00 guilders on Wednesday.</p>
